{"id": 43793293, "slug": "rmb-update-lucky-number-7", "title": "RMB update - Lucky number 7", "subtitle": "August 4th, 2019", "post_date": "2021-11-09T19:41:05.353Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 90, "reaction_count": 0, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 0}, "body_html": "<p>China\u2019s yuan (as proxed by the USDCNH exchange rate) below 7 tonight.</p><p>Media having a hard time differentiating between whether it \u2018fell\u2019 or was \u2018pegged\u2019 lower.</p><p>Regardless of if it was market driven or pegging, once USDCNH got past 7, it kept running.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lMQW!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac19c961-5400-429e-b9af-7b8caf4e0cbc_990x588.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lMQW!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac19c961-5400-429e-b9af-7b8caf4e0cbc_990x588.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lMQW!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac19c961-5400-429e-b9af-7b8caf4e0cbc_990x588.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lMQW!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac19c961-5400-429e-b9af-7b8caf4e0cbc_990x588.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lMQW!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaw